{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01820",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.17,
      "end_seconds": 10.22,
      "duration_seconds": 9.05,
      "text": "Doctor, the patient's with us now. I did the usual checks at the front, so just say when you want them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.04,
      "end_seconds": 17.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Great. Hello, come in and sit down. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.46,
      "end_seconds": 25.93,
      "duration_seconds": 6.47,
      "text": "so the thing is I've got red sore skin on my shoulders"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.54,
      "end_seconds": 33.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "what do you do to make it better?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.21,
      "end_seconds": 39.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Only cool showers, you know, and it's not much."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.27,
      "end_seconds": 44.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.54,
      "end_seconds": 63.79,
      "duration_seconds": 19.25,
      "text": "Um, when it starts I tend to get tightness of the skin as well. Oh, and a little peeling. With little peeling, severe, I'd say. The tightness of the skin? That's been for two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.2,
      "end_seconds": 68.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.07,
      "end_seconds": 71.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Moderate I'd say"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.09,
      "end_seconds": 80.0,
      "duration_seconds": 6.91,
      "text": "have you had red sore skin on your shoulders before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.4,
      "end_seconds": 87.44,
      "duration_seconds": 6.04,
      "text": "I had a similar thing about six months ago. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.51,
      "end_seconds": 91.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "And what about vomiting, blisters or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.8,
      "end_seconds": 96.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Right no none that that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.91,
      "end_seconds": 101.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "How about headache?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.14,
      "end_seconds": 104.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "oh no none no headache"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.38,
      "end_seconds": 108.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.32,
      "end_seconds": 111.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "no, nothing there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.04,
      "end_seconds": 117.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.6,
      "end_seconds": 123.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.37,
      "end_seconds": 128.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "now some background about your lifestyle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.81,
      "end_seconds": 138.97,
      "duration_seconds": 9.16,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I walk the dog every morning. I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.42,
      "end_seconds": 154.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "what about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.78,
      "end_seconds": 162.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "I've had arthritis in my knees for about ten years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.03,
      "end_seconds": 166.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Okay, go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.47,
      "end_seconds": 175.23,
      "duration_seconds": 7.76,
      "text": "I've got heart disease. I looked a a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.82,
      "end_seconds": 179.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Right, and anything else to add?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.76,
      "end_seconds": 189.07,
      "duration_seconds": 8.31,
      "text": "okay, I can see arthritis in your knees in your file as well. What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.71,
      "end_seconds": 193.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "I mean I take diclofenac when needed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.27,
      "end_seconds": 196.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "how much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.43,
      "end_seconds": 203.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "50 milligrams i take metoprolol, twice a day for my heart"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.11,
      "end_seconds": 206.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.57,
      "end_seconds": 212.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "50 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.93,
      "end_seconds": 214.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "When did you start it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.69,
      "end_seconds": 220.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "For about a year. I take after-sun lotion twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.4,
      "end_seconds": 237.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.94,
      "end_seconds": 243.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "I had a triple bypass eight years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 244.8,
      "end_seconds": 256.25,
      "duration_seconds": 11.45,
      "text": "doctor I've got the readings for you blood pressure 120 over 76 temperature 36.9 oxygen saturation is 99 percent heart rate 75 respiratory rate 16."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.4,
      "end_seconds": 258.1,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.98,
      "end_seconds": 262.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "may I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.88,
      "end_seconds": 266.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.77,
      "end_seconds": 281.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "the skin is pink and tender with no blistering"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.66,
      "end_seconds": 290.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "good, you can sit up again"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.5,
      "end_seconds": 309.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "okay so my impression is this: This is probably mild sunburn"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.57,
      "end_seconds": 313.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Um, is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.08,
      "end_seconds": 347.43,
      "duration_seconds": 33.35,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like mild sunburn. Cool compresses, moisturiser and stay out of the sun for a few days. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest. If the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently. Come back if blisters develop. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 348.89,
      "end_seconds": 351.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "thank you, that's helpful"
    }
  ]
}